  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量千川-工具\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量千川\"],\"capability_summary\":\"该接口用于解决创建计划时，设置抖音达人定向需要的相关id值，将返回抖音类目id值。适用场景为创建计划时设置抖音达人定向。关键配合接口有【获取Access-Token】、【附录-抖音达人互动用户行为类型】、【附录-返回码】。\",\"id\":\"ad.aweme_multi_level_category.get\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/tools/aweme_multi_level_category/get/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1697466893806595\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"get_access_token\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"请求该接口需要授权Access-Token，获取方法见此接口文档\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access-Token\"},{\"id\":\"appendix_douyin_user_behavior_types\",\"path\":\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?key=qianchuan\\u0026type=api\\u0026id=1697577930691592#item-link-20\",\"reason\":\"请求参数中抖音用户行为类型的取值需参考此文档\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"附录-抖音达人互动用户行为类型\"},{\"id\":\"appendix_return_codes\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760866831\",\"reason\":\"应答参数中的返回码和返回信息的含义需参考此文档\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"附录-返回码\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1697466893806595\",\"title\":\"查询抖音类目列表\"}",
